  "caption_tex": "Mean total evaluation scores on RT-1 (maximum 10). SFT and RoboImagine use matched trajectories within each evaluator: Qwen3-VL-8B-Thinking ($n=97$), Doubao Seed 2.1 Pro ($n=10$), and GPT-6 Astra ($n=50$, session-based evaluation). All comparisons use one fixed RoboImagine hybrid-feedback configuration. Error bars denote 95\\% trajectory-bootstrap confidence intervals. Percentages are relative increases over each evaluator's SFT mean; the highlighted 10.28\\% is their unweighted macro-average across the three different cohorts. All evaluators receive the instruction, initial observation, and eight sampled predicted frames.",
